    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "right, that makes sense. it's probably just the way we're loading the heavier parts. but honestly, sometimes it feels almost intentional, like a single box will just shift out of place or a corner will suddenly loosen up even when we think it's locked down. do you have any tips for preventing those little \"unexplained\" shifts that happen during the move?",
